  "term": "AI",
  "definition": "In this learning context, AI refers to computer-based support systems that assist students during complex bilingual tasks, such as tools that use automatic speech recognition and machine translation. Students may rely on these systems in different ways across stages of a task, and those interaction patterns can relate to training and performance.",
